- Power: always-on (sleep=0, womp=1, autorestart=1).
- Firewall: off (mosh UDP 60000-61000 open).

## What runs here

- **Claude Code CLI** (`claude` on PATH) — for headless invocations.
- **Claude Desktop** — only if installed manually post-bootstrap.

## Tools

- `tmux` (`~/.tmux.conf`: mouse, 50k scrollback, vi keys) — wrap long agent runs in `tmux new -s <name>`.
- `mosh` — for flaky-network SSH from the workstation.
- `tailscale` — App Store build, sandboxed (no Tailscale SSH; we use plain SSH).
- Homebrew, Node, npm.

## Shell init

- `~/.zshenv` — loaded by ALL shells. Has brew + tool PATH.
- `~/.zprofile` — login shells only.
- `~/.zshrc` — interactive shells only.

## Workspace layout

```
~/Documents/Claude/Unlok/   <- you are here
