## Conventions

- Long-running agent work: `tmux new -s agent-<topic>` then detach.
- Logs: `~/agents/logs/YYYY-MM-DD-HH-<task>.log`.
- Repo: https://github.com/ASM-TECH-MIAMI/unlok-fleet (bootstrap, scripts, fleet management).
